#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Make the pictures in plugins/screenshots/ with the simulator.

    tools/screenshots               every plugin
    tools/screenshots snake trivia  only these

Each plugin is run by tools/sim/run.sh the way its recipe below says: which
settings, which buttons when, and for the plugins that need an account, a
sample answer from tools/sim/replies/ instead of the network. Cards that show
the time get a fixed moment (--time) and games a fixed --seed, so a picture only
changes when its plugin does. A plugin without a recipe is simply run for two
seconds.

The picture is the card at twice its size, 466 by 270 pixels. Afterwards run
`tools/deskhog index`, which lists the pictures in plugins/index.json and in
the README.
"""

